<cell>Suppose the solid <m>W</m> in the figure is a cone centered 
about the positive z-axis with its vertex at the origin, 
a <m>90^{\circ}</m> angle at its vertex, and topped by a 
sphere radius <m>6</m>.
Find the limits of integration for an iterated integral 
of the form
<m>\displaystyle
\iiint\limits_W \, dV
=
\int_A^B \!\! \int_C^D \!\! \int_E^F \! dz \, dy \, dx.</m>
